edback related to resolving bugs and  improving gameplay again the 3.2 update  for battlefield 2042 goes live on  january 20th and it's a zero downtime  update so players can jump right in  after the download finishes a size for  the install however was not announced  after this another update is coming in  february for battlefield 2042 that's  going to include some quality of life  improvements in new features including  the long-awaited new scoreboard ui but  still no voice chat we also have the  full list of patch notes on our site  right now  with only a few more weeks before it  arrives sony has released a brand new  trailer for horizon forbidden west  unlike the other trailers that focused  on tribes hostile mechanical wildlife  and robots with impressive swimming  skills the latest trailer focuses on  just what spurs ailoy to embark on a new  adventure and the dangers that lie  hidden in the sinister landscape of  forbidden west the trailer shows a  strange blight that has begun sweeping  across the world and killing off all  life machines have begun to grow more  aggressive towards humans and the key to  saving the world lies in the forbidden  west eloy will have to explore this  unknown region and in the process she'll  encounter regala described as a warrior  who seeks to slaughter all those who  have wronged her and will kill anyone  who gets in her way pretty much like  every villain ever made but let's roll  with it regala is voiced by angela  bassett and will battle aeloy throughout  the course of the game the real twist in  the trailer though is that horizon zero  dawn's nomadic researcher silence has  returned and is pulling several strings  behind the scenes aloy won't be alone in  her quest though as her allies errand  and varl will lend her a hand from time  to time other new faces include the  tinath tribe warrior kotalo the curious  explorer alva who hails from an unknown  tribe and the uttaru tribes zou lastly  the trailer confirms that artificial  intelligence gaia will also return while  another character by the name of tilda  will be brought to life by the matrix's  very own carrion moss horizon forbidden  west is launching on ps4 and five on  february 18th which is officially less  than a month away  february is going to be full of releases  but what are you looking forward to the  most and why let me know in the comments  and of course leave a like subscribe and  make sure you tune in tomorrow for your  next gamespot news update we'll see you  later
 

